            "text": "{\"created_at\":\"2026-10-23T19:25:54.901664Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-23T19:25:57.663657Z\",\"org_id\":\"01a16a39-5a8d-74d0-b5c2-7fdc69e7f1a2\",\"project_id\":\"01a16a39-5ab7-77f8-9b3c-066d4cea20e2\",\"id\":\"01a16a3a-1954-7172-b6e3-f25c57f3128b\",\"title\":\"Call the `echo` tool from the declared `hello-mcp` MCP server with the message `hello from the public MCP`. Write the echoed value exactly, with no quotes or additional formatting, to `/workspace/outputs/greeting.txt`. Then run `echo $WALK_MARKER` in…\",\"display_index\":6,\"status\":\"idle\",\"kind\":\"agent\",\"member_id\":\"8f8490f7-8fb9-5664-a2bc-b72c2590e320\",\"automation_id\":null,\"runtime_group_id\":\"01a16a39-6fcb-7605-9ea0-074e36b92c1b\",\"runtime_id\":\"01a16a39-8338-756e-8ec2-303605c1dd7a\",\"is_archived\":false,\"started_at\":\"2026-10-23T19:25:57.505280Z\",\"completed_at\":null,\"last_user_message_at\":\"2026-10-23T19:25:54.902323Z\",\"metadata\":{\"act\":{\"sub\":\"01a16a39-5aa9-747e-bdb4-3119573c22c2\",\"type\":\"agent\"},\"error\":null,\"suite\":\"walk\",\"memory\":{\"remote_prefix\":\"memory/production/member:8f8490f7-8fb9-5664-a2bc-b72c2590e320/\"},\"identity\":{\"user_id\":\"walk-avery\"},\"agent_name\":\"scripted\",\"turn_count\":1,\"image_build\":{\"launch\":\"baked\",\"git_sha\":\"543b8db50a839029b03d7ca7957884d806df646c\",\"build_id\":\"01a16a39-72e4-7197-b96e-56b5af93542e\",\"image_digest\":\"host.docker.internal:5001/sandbox-builds@sha256:06de32bcb57d2f2b035b850bc59f8ee1d323e9c2bad6ee1a77ea565235e983d8\"},\"task_prompt\":null,\"active_run_id\":null,\"invocation_id\":\"inv_1l9gQD5zMOXj6jlwV1ObqMBy7eJhIyaoD6\",\"last_response\":{\"turn\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-23T19:25:57.643Z\",\"response_id\":\"chatcmpl-64c583c525d0468fa756cdedb031c9cb\"},\"latest_run_id\":\"01a16a3a-1954-7172-b6e3-f25b65f3ca8f\",\"crash_restarts\":null,\"history_recall\":null,\"pending_resume\":null,\"conversation_id\":\"01a16a3a-1954-7172-b6e3-f25c57f3128b\",\"agent_session_id\":\"01a16a3